{"id": "21430", "title": "都市少年", "author": "一夜春风", "category": "其他类型", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/21/21430.htm", "intro": "都市少年行，仗剑闯江湖。&amp；amp；lt；br&amp；amp；gt；几人悲笑中，我意呈张狂。&amp；amp；lt；br&amp；amp；gt；留名闹市巷,青山几度红。&amp；amp；lt；br&amp；amp；gt；看我一平凡少年如何演驿平凡事记。看我普通少年却大才风流。虽说字少点。第五章后我一定把它冲到二千左右。但是我还是会努力用心去写。请大家支持我。&lt；br&gt；\r\n　　可能我的文笔很烂。但是我会努力把我心中想写的写出来。不好请不要骂我。谢谢。", "base": "files/article/html/21/21430", "chapters": [{"title": "作品相关", "volume": true}, {"title": "经脉", "file": "1591442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "引子（求票）", "file": "1591446.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章学校处理（求票）", "file": "1591447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章初成（求票）", "file": "1591452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章晨练耍帅（求票）", "file": "1591456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章传功（求票）", "file": "1591458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章期中将至（求票）", "file": "1591463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章期中将至（中）", "file": "1591474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章期中将至（下）", "file": "1591479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章惊吓", "file": "1591482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章寻法", "file": "1591485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章解决", "file": "1591490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章嬉戏", "file": "1591495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章精进", "file": "1591498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章立志", "file": "1591502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章回忆", "file": "1591505.html", "available": false}]}